  title: Sixteen Mahajanapadas
  text: Buddhist and Jain texts list sixteen great states, or mahajanapadas, around the 6th century BCE, among them Magadha, Kosala, Vatsa, Avanti, Kashi, Anga, Vajji, Malla, Kuru, Panchala, Gandhara, Kamboja, Chedi, Matsya, Surasena and Assaka.
